WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.300
This is what a finished Module 2 run looks
like.

2
00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:08.775
You will see the tool that grades you, and
one failure that looks like broken Python.

3
00:00:09.125 --> 00:00:12.525
You will not see any code, because the
code is yours.

4
00:00:12.875 --> 00:00:15.075
Module 2 has two parts.

5
00:00:15.425 --> 00:00:19.775
Part one is get_customer. Its schema is
already written for you.

6
00:00:20.125 --> 00:00:23.200
Part two is one tool you design yourself.

7
00:00:23.550 --> 00:00:27.225
There, the schema is the graded part, not
the Python.

8
00:00:27.575 --> 00:00:30.275
Writing a function is Week 4 work.

9
00:00:30.625 --> 00:00:34.850
Writing an interface another program has
to understand is new.

10
00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:38.500
The model reads your description and
nothing else.

11
00:00:38.850 --> 00:00:42.950
The grader is a command, and you may run
it as often as you like.

12
00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:47.375
Run it before you write anything, so you
know what failing looks like.

13
00:00:47.725 --> 00:00:50.675
Five failed, one passed, seven skipped.

14
00:00:51.025 --> 00:00:54.925
The seven skipped are waiting for the tool
you have not written yet.

15
00:00:55.275 --> 00:00:58.125
That is a starting line, not a problem.

16
00:00:58.475 --> 00:01:01.675
Now the same command against work that is
finished.

17
00:01:02.025 --> 00:01:04.975
Thirteen passed, in well under a second.

18
00:01:05.325 --> 00:01:07.825
It is the same tool that grades you.

19
00:01:08.175 --> 00:01:11.625
So nothing is waiting to surprise you at
the deadline.

20
00:01:11.975 --> 00:01:14.925
Your tool name has to go in two places.

21
00:01:15.275 --> 00:01:19.800
Here is the allowed list in the config
file, with a new name on the end.

22
00:01:20.150 --> 00:01:25.150
That name was never added to TOOLS, the
registry in your tools file.

23
00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:29.900
Now run the agent. It stops before it asks
the model anything.

24
00:01:30.250 --> 00:01:35.100
The error names the tool that is missing,
then every tool that is registered.

25
00:01:35.450 --> 00:01:40.000
Miss the other list instead and your tool
is never offered to the model.

26
00:01:40.350 --> 00:01:44.050
The model never picks it, and nothing
looks broken at all.

27
00:01:44.400 --> 00:01:50.000
Here is a good run. T-501 is an ordinary
ticket with nothing hidden in it.

28
00:01:50.350 --> 00:01:53.750
The agent ran search_tickets and read the
ticket back.

29
00:01:54.100 --> 00:01:58.900
Save this whole output. It is the run
transcript the assignment asks for.

30
00:01:59.250 --> 00:02:02.500
Replay walks that same run one step at a
time.

31
00:02:02.850 --> 00:02:04.725
You asked for a summary.

32
00:02:05.075 --> 00:02:07.468
The model asked for a tool, and the line

33
00:02:07.468 --> 00:02:10.400
under it says nothing in your program
chose that.

34
00:02:10.750 --> 00:02:15.825
Then your code ran the tool and got back
two hundred and thirty six characters.

35
00:02:16.175 --> 00:02:19.000
The model asks. Your code answers.

36
00:02:19.350 --> 00:02:22.050
Three failures cost the most points here.

37
00:02:22.400 --> 00:02:25.050
A schema that lies about your function.

38
00:02:25.400 --> 00:02:30.250
The autograder builds arguments from your
schema and calls your function with them.

39
00:02:30.600 --> 00:02:34.125
A tool registered in one list and not the
other.

40
00:02:34.475 --> 00:02:36.975
And an empty string when the call fails.

41
00:02:37.325 --> 00:02:41.625
The agent carries on as if it worked, and
your log agrees with it.

42
00:02:41.975 --> 00:02:44.750
One zip file, holding five things.

43
00:02:45.100 --> 00:02:50.325
Your tools file, your config file, your
run transcript, ANSWERS and AI-USE.

44
00:02:50.675 --> 00:02:53.825
No dot env file, and no runs folder.

45
00:02:54.175 --> 00:02:58.600
AI-USE needs one suggestion you turned
down, with a real reason.

46
00:02:58.950 --> 00:03:01.250
It was wrong is not a reason.

47
00:03:01.600 --> 00:03:04.185
It caught every exception, which would
have

48
00:03:04.185 --> 00:03:06.950
hidden the missing customer case, is a
reason.
